## Intent Definitions
- book_flight: User wants to book, reserve, or schedule air travel
- order_food: User wants to order, get, or buy food or drinks
- check_weather: User wants to know weather, temperature, or forecast
- cancel_booking: User wants to cancel a reservation, order, or booking
- track_order: User wants to track, locate, or check status of an order
- set_reminder: User wants to set a reminder, alarm, or alert
- play_music: User wants to play, listen to, or start music
- out_of_scope: User's request does not match any of the above intents

